// txExternalPrototype, and what only it reaches
//
// The template of a text view's document as a frame (Externalize) when
// it is kept in memory: the string, styles and rulers, and in txData the
// line breaks and other layout state. txExternalVboPrototype is the same
// for a document kept on a store.

txExternalPrototype := {text: nil, styles: nil, rulers: nil, txData: nil};
